        <ol class="essentials">
          <li>X-Men (2000): Stewart, McKellen, Marsden, Romijn: the Fox X-Men who return in Doomsday.</li>
<li>X2: X-Men United (2003): Best Fox X-Men; adds Alan Cumming&#x27;s Nightcrawler (in Doomsday).</li>
<li>Captain America: The First Avenger (2011): Steve, Peggy and Bucky: all three in Doomsday.</li>
<li>The Avengers (2012): The team assembles; Loki&#x27;s villain turn.</li>
<li>Avengers: Infinity War (2018): The Snap; Russo-scale ensemble storytelling.</li>
<li>Avengers: Endgame (2019): Steve&#x27;s ending and the time heist; watch the 2026 Encore cut.</li>
<li>The Falcon and the Winter Soldier (2021): Sam takes the shield; Walker and Joaquin Torres debut.</li>
<li>Loki (2021–23) (2021): TVA and He Who Remains break the multiverse open; S2 ends with Loki holding it together, where Endgame Encore picks up.</li>
