<li>Deadpool &amp; Wolverine (2024): Tatum&#x27;s Gambit, the TVA, the Void: the Fox-to-MCU bridge.</li>
<li>Captain America: Brave New World (2025): Sam Wilson&#x27;s first film as Captain America.</li>
<li>Thunderbolts* (2025): Yelena&#x27;s team becomes the New Avengers; Sentry debuts.</li>
